### Get all deals
GET http://localhost:5000/api/DealForm

### Create a new deal
POST http://localhost:5000/api/DealForm
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "leadContactName": "Test User",
    "leadEmail": "test@example.com",
    "leadPhone": "1234567890",
    "dealName": "Test Deal",
    "pipeline": "Sales Pipeline",
    "dealStage": "Generated",
    "dealValue": 50000.00,
    "closeDate": "2026-03-29T00:00:00Z",
    "dealCategory": "consulting",
    "products": "HRM System",
    "dealAgent": "Miza",
    "dealWatcher": "Miza"
}
